cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the pre-print below."
title: "Pathview-plus: pathway visualisation for KEGG and SBGN with multi-omics overlay"
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of R pathview and SBGNview. Overlays transcript,
  protein and metabolite data on KEGG and SBGN pathway diagrams with
  independent colour scales per data class, and bundles offline reference data
  for 10,718 organisms and 5,206 pre-generated SBGN pathways.
